              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũkeeka o tondũ nĩkĩte: mũtikavw’ĩka ilomo syenyu, kana kũya lĩu wa andũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.22",
