        },
        {
          "text": "Naku, mwana wa mũndũ, kũtikethĩwa mũthenya yĩla nĩmaumya vinya woo, ũtanu wa ndaĩa yoo, kĩla kyendetwe nĩ metho moo, na kĩla mend na ngoo yoo, ana moo na eĩtu moo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
