          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthenya ũsu kanyw’a waku ũkaathamw’a kwa ũsu mũvonoku, na ũkaneena, na ndũkethĩwa ũtatonya kũneena ĩngĩ: o ta ũu ũkeethĩwa ũvano kwoo; nao makamanya ninyie Yeova.",
